      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Under date of January 10, 1946, the Mayor transmitted to all heads of departments Memorandum #2 requesting the preparation of an organization chart for each department along the lines indicated in the memorandum. This organization chart should have been received at the office of the Mayor not later than January 18th.",
