      "category": "Text",
      "text": "It has now come to my attention that some of the departments claim that the memorandum was not received by them. I am therefore enclosing another copy of Memorandum #2. The Mayor would appreciate it if all organization charts were in his hands not later than Friday, February 1, 1946. Please have the charts directed to my attention.",
